rows.en:
When he got there, light was spilling out of the restroom.
So it was here after all.
He peered into the restroom.{p}

One after another they dropped to the floor and huddled together in a tumbling, rolling heap.
Then they slipped right past him as he stood frozen, and rolled out of the restroom.
They didn't seem to see him at all.{p}

I'm so happy.
We really are best friends.
Come on, then, let's go.{p}

As he said that, Hosoda pulled a knife out of his pocket.
The blade sprang out with a snap.
Small, but it had a wicked, sharp gleam.{p}

Swish. A hot line ran across my belly.
A moment later came pain so bad I couldn't breathe.
A feeling like my skin was being stretched.{p}

I'd had all I could take.
"Let's go back."
With that, I turned on my heel.{p}

In that instant, terror hit me like ice water poured down my back.
Someone was behind me.
I slowly turned around.{p}

But just then, the girl gave a slight shrug.
"Enough."
As she said it, I felt dizzy for a moment.{p}

Leaving those cryptic words behind, the girl vanished into the second stall.
Yes, she literally vanished.
Even when I ran after her and looked in, there wasn't so much as a trace of her left.{p}
